ith our <strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"994\">custom beam and truss installations<\/strong>. We work with premium wood to bring structure and style to your vaulted ceilings, enhancing warmth, texture, and architectural interest.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n          \n  \t\t        \n          \n  \t\t\n  \t\t  \n<\/div>\n<!-- end Icon Box -->\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-cac31b6\" data-id=\"cac31b6\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88bab11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-ucaddon_square_icon_box\" data-id=\"88bab11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"ucaddon_square_icon_box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<!-- start Icon Box -->\n\n<style>\/* widget: Icon Box *\/\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11 * { \n\tbox-sizing: border-box; \n}\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11{\n  font-family: inherit;\n  position:relative;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11 svg{\n  width:1em;\n  height:1em;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11 .blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-icon{\n\tposition:relative;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    transform:rotate(0deg);\n    z-index:2;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11 .ue-icon {\n  display:inline-block;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11 .blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-icon > div{\n\tposition:relative;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:center;\n    align-items:center;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11 .ue-icon-inner{\n    line-height:1em;\n\t} \t\n\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11 .ue-icon-inner svg{\n    height:1em;\n    width:1em;\n\t} \t\n\t\n.blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-heading{\n\tfont-size:21px;\n\t}\n\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11:hover\n{\n  position:relative;\n  z-index:1;\n}\n\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11 .ue-title-separator span\n{\n  display:inline-block;\n}\n\n\n\n\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"square_icon_box elementor-animation-float\" id=\"uc_square_icon_box_elementor_88bab11\">\n  \n         \n                <div  class=\"blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-heading\">Coffered & Tray Ceilings<\/div>\n         \n  \t\t             <div class=\"ue-title-separator\">\n               <span><\/span>\n             <\/div>\n          \n  \n                <div class=\"blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-content\">\n        \t<p data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1382\">For homeowners who want refined sophistication, <strong data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1242\">coffered and tray ceilings<\/strong> offer layered dimension and a luxurious finish. These features add visual depth and value to your dining room, den, or formal living space.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n          \n  \t\t        \n          \n  \t\t\n  \t\t  \n<\/div>\n<!-- end Icon Box -->\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-82e3f78 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"82e3f78\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-80bc511\" data-id=\"80bc511\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-898ea51 eleme