the outdoors in with <strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1518\">strategically placed skylights, clerestory windows, or glass inserts<\/strong>. Vaulted ceilings paired with natural light bring brightness and life to any space, reducing your energy usage while improving aesthetics.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n          \n  \t\t        \n          \n  \t\t\n  \t\t  \n<\/div>\n<!-- end Icon Box -->\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-29cf5a4\" data-id=\"29cf5a4\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f93f37 elementor-widget elementor-widget-ucaddon_square_icon_box\" data-id=\"1f93f37\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"ucaddon_square_icon_box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<!-- start Icon Box -->\n\n<style>\/* widget: Icon Box *\/\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37 * { \n\tbox-sizing: border-box; \n}\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37{\n  font-family: inherit;\n  position:relative;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37 svg{\n  width:1em;\n  height:1em;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37 .blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-icon{\n\tposition:relative;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    transform:rotate(0deg);\n    z-index:2;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37 .ue-icon {\n  display:inline-block;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37 .blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-icon > div{\n\tposition:relative;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:center;\n    align-items:center;\n}\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37 .ue-icon-inner{\n    line-height:1em;\n\t} \t\n\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37 .ue-icon-inner svg{\n    height:1em;\n    width:1em;\n\t} \t\n\t\n.blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-heading{\n\tfont-size:21px;\n\t}\n\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37:hover\n{\n  position:relative;\n  z-index:1;\n}\n\n\n#uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37 .ue-title-separator span\n{\n  display:inline-block;\n}\n\n\n\n\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"square_icon_box elementor-animation-float\" id=\"uc_square_icon_box_elementor_1f93f37\">\n  \n         \n                <div  class=\"blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-heading\">Custom Lighting & Fixtures<\/div>\n         \n  \t\t             <div class=\"ue-title-separator\">\n               <span><\/span>\n             <\/div>\n          \n  \n                <div class=\"blox-boxed-small-square-icon-box-content\">\n        \t<p data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1937\">From dramatic chandeliers to soft recessed lighting or indirect cove illumination, we help you create <strong data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1824\">the perfect lighting setup<\/strong> to showcase your new vaulted ceiling. Your ceiling isn\u2019t just higher \u2014 it\u2019s smarter, warmer, and more inspiring.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n          \n  \t\t        \n          \n  \t\t\n  \t\t  \n<\/div>\n<!-- end Icon Box -->\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-8bfc3f7\" data-id=\"8bfc3f7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b9e8811 elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"b9e8811\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&q